  "contentHtml": "<h1 id=\"block-76e70e698ae246038d3346154e0b1655\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Hébergements</h1><h2 id=\"block-1390d149331780238fa5f256bebc3c6d\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">🛏️&nbsp;Gites</h2><h3 id=\"block-1390d14933178029a3d9efe26fce09ea\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\"><a href=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/la-cheveche-gite-8-personnes\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/la-cheveche-gite-8-personnes\">La Chevêche</a> (8 personnes)</h3><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-3910d149331780ca9e78ccd9aa62284c\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en semaine : 200 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d1493317804fada9fdf9331aea62\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en week-end (uniquement du 15 novembre au 14 mars) : 260 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780489feaf98b6c26184f\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">un week-end (2 nuits) : 480 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780e2a3f7df04be65fd59\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au vendredi (4 nuits) : 780 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780fa9f1ef7b2335b2d3a\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au dimanche (6 nuits) : 995 € </li></ul><h3 id=\"block-1390d1493317805d9022e1d048eceace\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\"><a href=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/la-hulotte-gite-16-personnes\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/la-hulotte-gite-16-personnes\">La Hulotte</a> (15 personnes)</h3><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-3910d14933178052bc16d2d804089036\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en semaine : 400 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780beb8f6e096d4c24124\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en week-end (uniquement du 15 novembre au 14 mars) : 485 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d1493317806caff7fd259b3c5949\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">un week-end (2 nuits) : 910 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780c69adfd97e418473ca\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au vendredi (4 nuits) : 1 490 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780db8a1bff303f07caff\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au dimanche (6 nuits) : 1 900 €</li></ul><h3 id=\"block-1390d14933178053990ee31aa1c7a284\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\"><a href=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/le-grand-duc-gite-25-personnes\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/le-grand-duc-gite-25-personnes\">Le Grand-Duc</a> (23 personnes)</h3><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-3910d149331780698a85e9d5f81fa6af\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en semaine : 650 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780d3934bda8f8766a745\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">1 nuit en week-end (uniquement du 15 novembre au 14 mars) : 750 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780dd89cbdaa423eda0ec\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">un week-end (2 nuits) : 1 350&nbsp;€</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780f8b948f888337b4188\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au vendredi (4 nuits) : 2 410 €</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780e09d27cc76c7fc7766\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">du lundi au dimanche (6 nuits) : 2 900 €</li></ul><p id=\"block-1a50d14933178055afd6c700e9308846\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Charges, nettoyage et taxes compris</p><p id=\"block-1a50d149331780679d65cb4394af0cb1\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ À emporter avec vous : draps de lit, essuies de bain, essuies de vaisselle et savons biodégradables</p><h3 id=\"block-1b00d149331780a49b83fd0813e0fc04\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Services payants</h3><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-1b00d149331780ecbdfdf4d62c213e6a\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Draps de lit pour lit simple : 10€</li><li id=\"block-1b00d1493317803aa731c07913580368\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Draps de lit pour lit double : 20€</li><li id=\"block-1b00d14933178020970ae6e25b527782\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Une brouette de bûches (Chevêche et Grand-Duc) : 10€</li><li id=\"block-1b00d149331780e0af81db8c19575b29\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Chien : 50€/séjour et maximum 2 chiens</li></ul><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780a5bad0f2c3d2887e45\" class=\"notion-callout bg-green-light border\"><div class=\"notion-callout__content\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"></span><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780bfb660d19d0fa22a93\" class=\"notion-button\"><a href=\"https://formulaires.les4sources.be/sejour\" class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"notion-button__icon\"><img src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" alt=\"icon\" class=\"notion-icon\" data-full-size=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\"></div><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">C'est parti, je fais une demande de séjour</span></a></div><p id=\"block-17f0d14933178030b7d4c2c3bc685464\" class=\"notion-text color-gray notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Notre super formulaire te permet de préciser tes besoins en matière d’hébergement, de salles et autres espaces, d’activités et de repas.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"block-59a705525d214148bc9d7560ca044192\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">🛌 Lits et chambres, avec accès aux espaces partagés</h2><p id=\"block-eecdd15d1e254787aaf8756dc2c2b9ac\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Seul·e, en couple, en famille ou en petits groupes, nous t’accueillons <strong>en semaine uniquement, </strong>les week-ends étant réservés aux groupes. Une chambre est mise à votre disposition et les espaces de vie (séjour et cuisine) sont partagés avec les autres personnes de passage.</p><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-1390d1493317804bbe29eafbe196abd5\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Enfants jusqu’à 3 ans : gratuit</li><li id=\"block-1390d1493317808fa325ef079f347ce4\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Enfants de 3 à 12 ans : 15 €/nuit</li><li id=\"block-1390d149331780308618e5f4021193ee\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">+ de 12 ans : 35 €/nuit</li></ul><p id=\"block-d1c6edd660d34185b88eae2fdc96062e\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">👉 Pour louer un lit ou une chambre, prends contact avec nous à <a href=\"mailto:sejours@les4sources.be\" class=\"notion-link link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sejours@les4sources.be</a>.</p><h2 id=\"block-dfe89e56e40e4157bbd411098c56c536\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">⛺️ Pour camper, en van aménagé ou camping-car</h2><div id=\"block-21d9201a95c74e148e18bda36a7239ba\" class=\"notion-column-list\"><div id=\"block-6676184832c14e9fa570473203d5809d\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><p id=\"block-632fdbcb4e344a99ad3189d17657198f\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><strong>En tente ou en hamac</strong></p><p id=\"block-d53552c374c34b978a77e697bd1f0199\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">✔️&nbsp;Accès aux sanitaires</p><p id=\"block-9bc7b65d8c7d43c394e69fdf47cb8d2f\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">✔️&nbsp;Cuisine extérieure</p><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-cf4884ae98d744a18912541032fd3ffc\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">7,5 €/nuit/personne</li><li id=\"block-1097ff9ac771404986be0e4d28268c04\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Location hamac/tarp/matelas isolant : 10 €</li></ul></div><div id=\"block-9f0f45e8d4964eeca3b3cee0ac4bec87\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><p id=\"block-a59d0c9e0980429aaa89b623d934c4ed\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><strong>En van aménagé / camping-car</strong></p><p id=\"block-9543562439274647a4b6b20085a066db\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">✔️&nbsp;Avec raccord électrique</p><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-bec2ebe5ca3c458da53e2d819999112f\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">15 €/nuit</li></ul></div></div><div id=\"block-2950d1493317808981f1ca31e9d6bc50\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/efce9279-a0a6-4521-897a-d4721ba5c18b/20240808_080152_29FD74F5/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/efce9279-a0a6-4521-897a-d4721ba5c18b/20240808_080152_29FD74F5/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/efce9279-a0a6-4521-897a-d4721ba5c18b/20240808_080152_29FD74F5/public\"></span></div><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780a5bad0f2c3d2887e45\" class=\"notion-callout bg-green-light border\"><div class=\"notion-callout__content\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"></span><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780bfb660d19d0fa22a93\" class=\"notion-button\"><a href=\"https://formulaires.les4sources.be/sejour\" class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"notion-button__icon\"><img src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" alt=\"icon\" class=\"notion-icon\" data-full-size=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\"></div><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">C'est parti, je fais une demande de séjour</span></a></div><p id=\"block-17f0d14933178030b7d4c2c3bc685464\" class=\"notion-text color-gray notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Notre super formulaire te permet de préciser tes besoins en matière d’hébergement, de salles et autres espaces, d’activités et de repas.</p></div></div><h1 id=\"block-ada1977ea77841d59f6b326c64e330cf\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Salles et cuisine professionnelle</h1><p id=\"block-774b0d66ca964084aa8210a24011ad1b\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Découvre <a href=\"/sejours/salles\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/sejours/salles\">les salles et la cuisine professionnelle</a> des 4 Sources. Des espaces pour tout type d’activités !</p><h3 id=\"block-1600d1493317808db966eb2b058666ba\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">🗓️ Du lundi au vendredi</h3><div class=\"notion-table__wrapper\"><table class=\"notion-table col-header\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__empty-cell\"></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Cuisine\npro</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">La petite\nsalle</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">La grande\nsalle</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Les\ndeux salles</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">2 heures</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">30€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">40€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">85€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">105€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Demi-journée /\nSoirée (*)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">70€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">90€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">190€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">250€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">1 jour (**)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">110€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">140€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">290€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">390€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">2 jours (**)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">210€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">270€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">540€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">750€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Forfait soir (***)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__empty-cell\"></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 30€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 60€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 90€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>5 jours</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>320€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>525€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>990€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>1.400€</strong></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"block-1600d149331780b4a07cd2e1a2f8f6a5\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">🗓️&nbsp;Le week-end (du vendredi soir au dimanche soir)</h3><div class=\"notion-table__wrapper\"><table class=\"notion-table col-header\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__empty-cell\"></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Cuisine\npro</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">La petite\nsalle</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">La grande\nsalle</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Les\ndeux salles</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">2 heures</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">45€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">55€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">110€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">145€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Demi-journée /\nSoirée (*)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">95€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">120€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">250€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">335€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">1 jour (**)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">150€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">190€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">380€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">495€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">2 jours (**)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">285€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">360€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">720€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">940€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Forfait soir (***)</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__empty-cell\"></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 40€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 75€</span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">+ 115€</span></div></td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>Du vendredi 18h30\nau dimanche soir</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>290€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>390€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>790€</strong></span></div></td><td><div class=\"notion-table__cell\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"><strong>990€</strong></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p id=\"block-3c9052a9cd7645f6a771354aa4b7dde9\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><em>(*) Demi-journée : de 8h à 13h ou de 13h à 18h / Soirée : de 18h à 23h</em></p><p id=\"block-1390d149331780d58354fdda740af93a\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><em>(**) Journée complète : de 8h à 18h</em></p><p id=\"block-1390d149331780569024c5a5e6e77d4b\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><em>(***) Forfait soir : pour prolonger votre location de jour jusqu’à 23h maximum</em></p><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780a5bad0f2c3d2887e45\" class=\"notion-callout bg-green-light border\"><div class=\"notion-callout__content\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"></span><div id=\"block-17f0d149331780bfb660d19d0fa22a93\" class=\"notion-button\"><a href=\"https://formulaires.les4sources.be/sejour\" class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"notion-button__icon\"><img src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" alt=\"icon\" class=\"notion-icon\" data-full-size=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://app.notion.com/icons/arrow-right_green.svg\"></div><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">C'est parti, je fais une demande de séjour</span></a></div><p id=\"block-17f0d14933178030b7d4c2c3bc685464\" class=\"notion-text color-gray notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Notre super f